### What is the cost per square foot for a Vancouver home renovation in 2026?

Vancouver renovation costs per square foot: Cosmetic refresh (paint, flooring, fixtures): $40–$80/sq ft. Standard mid-range renovation (kitchen, bathrooms, flooring): $80–$150/sq ft. Full gut renovation with structural and layout changes: $150–$350/sq ft. Custom/luxury renovation: $300–$600+/sq ft. For a 2,000 sq ft Vancouver home, a mid-range renovation runs $160,000–$300,000. Note: per-square-foot metrics are most useful for budgeting whole-home projects; individual room renovations (kitchen, bathroom) are better budgeted by scope since a 150 sq ft kitchen renovation doesn''t scale linearly from the per-sq-ft rate.

