## How Much Does a Renovation Cost in [Vancouver](/en/areas/vancouver/) in 2026?

If you are planning a renovation in Metro Vancouver, the first question on your mind is probably: "How much will this cost?" The answer depends on the type of project, the scope of work, your material choices, and your neighbourhood. But unlike most renovation websites that give you vague national averages, we are sharing real prices from our own completed projects across Metro Vancouver.

Below is a complete breakdown by project type, based on projects we finished in 2024–2026 across Vancouver, [Burnaby](/en/areas/burnaby/), [Richmond](/en/areas/richmond/), [Surrey](/en/areas/surrey/), [Coquitlam](/en/areas/coquitlam/), [Langley](/en/areas/langley/), [North Vancouver](/en/areas/north-vancouver/), [West Vancouver](/en/areas/west-vancouver/), [Delta](/en/areas/delta/), [Maple Ridge](/en/areas/maple-ridge/), [Port Moody](/en/areas/port-moody/) | [Port Coquitlam](/en/areas/port-coquitlam/), [New Westminster](/en/areas/new-westminster/), and [White Rock](/en/areas/white-rock/).

