<h2>What&#39;s Included in a Typical Burnaby Bathroom Renovation</h2>
<p>A full bathroom renovation in Burnaby typically includes:</p>
<p><strong>Demolition and prep</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Remove existing tile, vanity, toilet, tub/shower surround</li>
