<li><strong>Insurance certificate</strong> — contractor liability insurance naming the strata corporation</li>
<li><strong>Noise hours compliance</strong> — in most Burnaby stratas, noisy work is permitted Monday–Friday 8 AM–5 PM only</li>
<li><strong>Elevator booking</strong> — material deliveries and debris removal must use the service elevator</li>
