<p><strong>Can I stay in my condo during the renovation?</strong>
Yes, most clients do. We minimize dust spread with zippered barriers and clean the work area daily. For the 1–2 days of heaviest demolition, some clients prefer to stay elsewhere.</p>
<p><strong>Do I need a permit for a bathroom renovation in Burnaby?</strong>
If you&#39;re moving any plumbing or electrical, yes — a permit is required. If it&#39;s purely cosmetic (tile, paint, fixtures in the same location), a permit may not be required. We assess this during the quote visit and pull all necessary permits as part of our service.</p>
<p><strong>How do I avoid going over budget?</strong>
The two biggest sources of budget overruns are: (1) discovering water damage or rotten subfloor during demolition, and (2) changing your material selections after work has started. We address the first by inspecting thoroughly before pricing, and the second by finalizing all selections before construction begins.</p>
